  "question": {
    "text": "In the following structure, the double bonds are marked as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mi>II</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>III</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>IV</mi></math>.&nbsp;<br /><br /><img src=\"assets\\qt0322_1e18b5ec4a02.jpeg\" style=\"width: 160px; height: 108px;\" /><br /><br />&nbsp;Geometrical isomerism is not possible at the site(s):"
